WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.888
Lin Xiangru had won great merit, and his rank rose higher than Lian Po's.

00:00:04.238 --> 00:00:06.710
The old general Lian Po felt very unconvinced in his heart.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:11.428
Lian Po felt his years of fighting had earned even greater merit.

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:15.858
When Lin Xiangru went out, he often avoided Lian Po's carriage.

00:00:16.208 --> 00:00:18.680
His attendants did not understand, and thought him too timid.

00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:22.918
Lian Po even declared he would embarrass Lin Xiangru to his face.

00:00:23.268 --> 00:00:26.388
Lin Xiangru said: Qin is strong — we must not fight among ourselves.

00:00:26.738 --> 00:00:29.570
I avoid Lian Po for the sake of the country.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:32.872
When his attendants heard this, they lowered their heads and said no more.

00:00:33.222 --> 00:00:35.742
When Lian Po heard these words, he felt deeply ashamed.

00:00:36.092 --> 00:00:39.212
He understood he had been wrong, and decided to apologize in person.

00:00:39.562 --> 00:00:43.090
Lian Po, carrying thorns on his back, went to Lin Xiangru's home to ask forgiveness.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.848
Lin Xiangru quickly helped him up, and the two clasped hands tightly.

00:00:47.198 --> 00:00:50.630
People by the road who saw it were too astonished to speak.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:54.532
From then on the two were reconciled, and worked together for Zhao.

00:00:54.882 --> 00:00:58.074
"Carrying thorns to apologize" means apologizing with true sincerity.

00:00:58.424 --> 00:01:02.096
With Zhao united in one heart, Qin did not dare attack lightly.

